    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the \"quiet\" you're talking about... i don't mean just sitting in a room. i mean that feeling of finally not having to feel the weight of it all anymore. if the outcome is already decided and the suffering is guaranteed, why is it considered \"better\" to endure it? why is it wrong to just decide that you've seen enough and want to exit the situation before it gets even worse?",
